          "_comment": "How many (rate row, SUPPLIED formulation) pairs the general-fuel-ratio lookup reaches. 81 -- three crankcase pollutant-processes times the twenty-seven diesel model years 1980-2006 the table's band admits. Every one of them is on a CRANKCASE rate row, and a crankcase rate row has no rate to scale, which is the next assertion.",
