          "_comment": "The prefix count ZEROED on the rows that do not emit, so every emitting rate row has a dense 1..684 and every suppressed one has 0 (docs/esm-conventions.md 22 and 31). It is GLOBAL over the rate relation rather than per pollutant-process block, which is the one structural change this fixture makes to `process-tirewear`'s output stage: three of the six blocks are 124 cohorts long and three are 104, and a rank built from a block offset needs every block to be the same size.",
          "lhs": "rt_outputRank",
