        {
          "_comment": "The output relation is the 684 emitting rate rows crossed with the day types, rate-major. There is no pollutant-process factor in the layout at all: it is carried by the rate row the rank reaches, which is what makes ragged blocks cost nothing here.",
          "lhs": "outRateOrdinal",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
